Board documents (PDFs) go in this folder.

A file placed here is served from the site root, so
public/documents/2026-annual-minutes.pdf is reachable at
/documents/2026-annual-minutes.pdf — that's the path to use in the `url`
field of an entry's `files` array in content/documents.js.

Naming: lowercase with hyphens, keep the .pdf extension, no spaces.

Anything in this folder is publicly readable by anyone with the link and can
be indexed by search engines. There is no member login in front of it. Keep
documents that should be members-only in the member portal instead.

This file only exists so git tracks the (otherwise empty) folder. Delete it
once there are real documents here.
